                <pb facs="0644" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg548"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                José, Costa Rica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-09"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Revolution Mosquito territory. President Nicaragua requests you will send
                    immediately naval ship San Juan del Norte.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
